{"body":{"text":["What a use naming no component gives is drawn by the component that takes it, found by `fitting`, a function written in the language: of the components realized here, those that take all that is given, as a use giving it would be judged, and by a type of the field, some placeholder taking something given of a type it takes; so a brief draws as a brief, and a list with the direction it runs as a list. Whether a function or a component takes what is given is the native `takes`, giving what each placeholder takes or null: native because how a use's args meet an input is the evaluator's own, so the rule is written once and the chassis rebuilds nothing of the engine. \"we match against multiple arguments, not only one\" (20/27); \"if it's a two-liner of an expression that can replace over 100 lines of complicated code, naturally it's the right thing to do\" (20/27). A component over a kind of value alone, a list or a string, is never found so, since many take one shape for different ends, and is drawn only where a use names it; what nothing takes by a type is drawn by the fallback the chassis is given, Value, showing any holon as its values, so nothing is left unshown, and what holds no holon is given it at once, nothing read. One found is written into the use as its `fn` where the use's store takes the change, and found again each time where not; where several fit, a chooser lists them and the person's pick is drawn, never guessed. *Picked once and written, proposed, 18/88; finding by takes and fitting, the author's at 20/27, its shape the session's; built.*"]},"id":"1M84DMWBS0XF000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Natives are small pure functions in code, in families: the lazy ones, `if`, `case`, `and`, `or`; values; lists; sets, which are hashed; holons, `holon`, `whole`, `in`, `out`, `follow`, `takes`; history, `log`; and patterns; and the pairs glass ships, `parse` and `print`, `steps` and `chain`, with `each`, `group` and the way back, `back`. Beside them stand legacy natives, `type`, `store`, `named`, `children` and `since` among them, kept only while functions written in the field still call them. Everything else is written in the field upon the natives, as `sections`, which the brief component reads by, `wholes` and `roots`, and `fitting`, by which the chassis finds a component (20/16, 20/22, 20/28)."]},"id":"1M84DMWBS0XF001","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}